# Ignore local .claude session state, but TRACK the VerdiLabs shared-skills
# symlink so agents (and CI clones) get the skills. (Can't un-ignore a child if
# the parent dir is ignored, so ignore the CONTENTS of /.claude, then re-include
# the skills symlink.)
/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills
.serena/
Caddyfile
ecosystem.config.cjs

# ---- Agent instructions (not for distribution) -------------------------
.github/instructions/
